// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Captain James Harlan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P632071868" "Captain James Harlan"
// ProfessionString :
"P257343103" "US Army Captain"
// DescriptionString :
"P1419863885" "A stern and rugged man in his late thirties, Captain Harlan has spent his life working to protect the citizens of Paragon City. A veteran of the Rikti War, he now works to bring law and order back to the shattered streets of this once gleaming city. The official title of his current post is 'Military Law Enforcement Liaison,' and he commands a squad of hand-picked soldiers who work closely with Paragon City's police. Unofficially, Harlan's been known to step beyond his authority when the situation calls for it, by bringing in a little super-powered help. He hates to see a mystery go unsolved or a wrong go unrighted, which may be why the officers he works with speak of him so highly."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2795972436" "I don't talk to villains, {HeroName}."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3882837330" "I'm glad you're ready for duty, heroes; I could really use your help. My men are stretched too thin fighting the many battles in this lawless city, but I've got a situation that has to be dealt with post haste. I just got word that a young woman has been kidnapped by the Freakshow. I want you and your team to hunt those villains down and bring back the woman back to safety. Can you help?"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P993819141" "I'm sorry, but the people I'm up against are more than you can handle. If I send you in against them, I can't guarantee the safety of Paragon citizens. Come back after you've reached Security Level 34. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P1548736894" "I'm sure someone of your stature would be more helpful in other battles.  Perhaps you should seek out Major Flagg.  Last I had heard, he was coordinating mounting an offense against the Rikti in Peregrine Island. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P3856358019" "I have something that you might be able to help me with, but it's no simple task. Come back with a squad of at least four able-bodied heroes. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2613123987" "This is very classified information.  I must speak to your team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P1001676684" "When the entire team has arrived, I'll tell everyone the next part of the plan."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1896296825" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P3656750408" "Alpha"
// TaskForceName :
"P3761200395" "Bravo"
// TaskForceName :
"P4007882821" "Charlie"
// TaskForceName :
"P2346439865" "Delta"
// TaskForceName :
"P1466403022" "Tango"
// TaskForceName :
"P318864457" "Zulu"
// HelloString :
"P1097992599" "Hello."
// HelloString :
"P2095421216" "Atten'shun!"
// HelloString :
"P856719880" "Greetings."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1924466204" "Greetings there, hero. I think I've heard of you; aren't you the one {LastContactName} is looking for?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P856364347" ""
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2868894495" "Thank you for your help, soldier.  I'll put in a good word for you and your team with the brass."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3936323787" "You've done a lot for me, {TaskForceName}, but I'm afraid things are just getting started. You should take my phone number. I want you to contact me if things get hairy."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2257782202" "You've really proved yourselves to me, {TaskForceName}. But I'm afraid we've got more work to do."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P671790311" "FailsafeLevelString"
// LocationString :
"P1403482863" "Founders' Falls"
// IntroString :
"P1328994362" "Intro"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2865047185" "Accept"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4009846406" "Get out there and finish your mission, soldier!"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3958075051" "string"
