// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jane Hallaway 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4288337768" "Jane Hallaway"
// ProfessionString :
"P2450786827" "Investigative Reporter"
// DescriptionString :
"P3555777354" "A soft-spoken woman with an inquisitive gleam in her eyes, Jane has worked for the Paragon Times for years, uncovering corruption and hidden plots that grow like weeds in the seedy underground of Paragon City. Lately she's been following several disturbing leads about the Sky Raiders."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3249831782" "I've been hearing some strange rumors about the Sky Raiders lately. Word on the street is that they're closing in on some big goal. Don't spread this around, but I'm hoping you and some of your hero friends can assist me in my investigation. There's something huge going on here, and I'm determined to find out what."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2500295421" "My investigations aren't easy, and I don't want to see you get hurt. Perhaps you can help me when you reach Security Level 24. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P2663834865" "I'm sure a hero of your stature can do more good helping others. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P3321128098" "I could use your help, but things might get hairy. Come back with at least three other heroes. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P1492368788" "This is very sensitive information.  I must speak to your team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3681903196" "When the entire team has arrived, I'll tell you the plan."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P4213279446" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P1264046933" "Scoop"
// TaskForceName :
"P3548924086" "Pulitzer"
// TaskForceName :
"P559240445" "Front Page"
// TaskForceName :
"P2562480059" "Deadline"
// HelloString :
"P3288877441" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We've got work to do.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2068769087" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I hope you're ready for things to get dicey.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P292422045" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Don't expect this to be easy.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P48697984" "I'm sorry, but I'm chasing down a story. If you need a job, talk to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P151980984" "My investigations into the Sky Raiders have taken an ugly turn lately. I certainly hope you can help me get to the bottom of things. <br><br>You should probably start by speaking to my friend Jason Serano, over in Terra Volta. He's sort of a shady character, but he keeps me up to my ears in tips on the Sky Raiders."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P912025874" "I don't think there's anything else you can do for me. The entire city already owes you a debt of gratitude!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3416978744" "I'm glad you chose to work with me. I think I have another job for you, if you're interested. Take my number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2751659951" "You have been amazing, {HeroName}. Simply amazing. But it ain't over 'til it's over."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P389542859" "My friend, You've grown far beyond my little beat.  I've got no more leads for you, I'm afraid."
// LocationString :
"P224065995" "Independence Port"
// IntroString :
"P425623856" "There's someone I want to introduce you to: a reporter named Jane Hallaway. Some people think she'll do anything for a story, but between you and me, she's one of the good ones."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1675443263" "Choose Jane Hallaway"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2179884536" "Jane's a smart cookie who knows how to get to the truth. You should always trust her instincts."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3912547230" "There's someone I'd like to introduce you to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2930016262" "Would you care to meet one of my contacts?"
