// Contact Name : Major Richard Flagg 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P557971916" "Major Richard Flagg"
// ProfessionString :
"P72378788" "US Army Major"
// DescriptionString :
"P878471076" "One of the few military survivors of the Rikti Invasion, Major Flagg leads the troops massing to contain the aliens near the crash site. The major believes in that actions speak louder than words, and he expects those who work with him to perform to the best of their abilities, even when times get tough. He realizes that the future safety of the city, and perhaps the world, depends on the containment of the alien Rikti. He puts his whole heart into his post, earning him the unqualified admiration of his men."
// WrongAllianceString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P2322569813" "I'm sure heroes such as yourselves understand the importance of containing the Rikti threat. If you're willing to help me toward that end, it could mean a lot to the city. It appears that the Rikti have developed a new communications code, and it's a doozy. I can only conclude that they're working on a new plot, something they want to protect with the utmost secrecy."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1749041455" "I'm sorry, but the Rikti aren't your common enemy. We are recruiting only the strongest and toughest heroes out there. We might have something for you once you reach Security Level 44. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P2329899222" "Your skills would be put to better use elsewhere. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P2955008150" "This task is no cakewalk, soldier. You'll need at least four heroes to pull it off. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P522573833" "This is classified information. I must speak to your team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P1903856302" "When the entire team is here, I'll brief you on the plan."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2265766127" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P583430031" "Falcon"
// TaskForceName :
"P341774609" "Eagle"
// TaskForceName :
"P3282670828" "Crane"
// TaskForceName :
"P308808493" "Hawk"
// HelloString :
"P1890569092" "Hello"
// HelloString :
// HelloString :
"P356766018" "Greetings"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1605380902" "Greetings there, hero.  I don't think I've heard of you before."
// FirstVisitString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3321129593" "My friends, you are truly the best of the best. I'm confident you'll get to the bottom of this Rikti plot. Call me if you learn anything new."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P907037082" "{TaskForceName}, you may well be the saviors of Paragon City."
